(6504632, 967391, 28427, '<td valign="top">I suppose the darker part of the checkers should be considered as stripes? Or do you consider those cute little baby toes as stripes? Or the little stripes of the big toe?<br/>The DOF is nice, the red and green together makes this a refreshing photograph, but the stripes are a bit to subtle I''m afraid.  *5*</td>', 'I suppose the darker part of the checkers should be considered as stripes? Or do you consider those cute little baby toes as stripes? Or the little stripes of the big toe?The DOF is nice, the red and green together makes this a refreshing photograph, but the stripes are a bit to subtle I''m afraid.  *5*', '2011-08-15 06:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6504633, 967271, 116574, '<td valign="top">Don''t really see the strips.  They needed to be a bit more contrived to me for it to fit the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t really see the strips.  They needed to be a bit more contrived to me for it to fit the challenge.', '2011-08-15 06:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
