(6504646, 967202, 28427, '<td valign="top">Never easy to photograph fishes in a tank.  It''s hard to get the sharpness right, there are always air bubbles visible on the window.  These points make this photograph well succeeded.<br/>1 small point: the fin beneath could have used a bit more space from the border.</td>', 'Never easy to photograph fishes in a tank.  It''s hard to get the sharpness right, there are always air bubbles visible on the window.  These points make this photograph well succeeded.1 small point: the fin beneath could have used a bit more space from the border.', '2011-08-15 06:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
