(6504963, 967118, 15711, '<td valign="top">This works for me because the "stripes" of the floor go along with the wallpaper and her seams.  I think removing the table, lamp and that "thing" to the right (looks almost like a folded up comforter) might make it less busy and impactful, but I''m just rambling on.  What do I know?</td>', 'This works for me because the "stripes" of the floor go along with the wallpaper and her seams.  I think removing the table, lamp and that "thing" to the right (looks almost like a folded up comforter) might make it less busy and impactful, but I''m just rambling on.  What do I know?', '2011-08-15 12:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
