(6505091, 967366, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus on the face and the use of what I assume to be the diffuse window light there. I think the softness and the diffuse light falls off too quickly on the side of the head scarf and you are left with harder light and shadows which really takes away from that soft, feminine feel and dominates too big a portion of the frame. The textures are very different too because of the different light. Otherwise this is a really great shot and a wonderful take on the challenge.</td>', 'I like the soft focus on the face and the use of what I assume to be the diffuse window light there. I think the softness and the diffuse light falls off too quickly on the side of the head scarf and you are left with harder light and shadows which really takes away from that soft, feminine feel and dominates too big a portion of the frame. The textures are very different too because of the different light. Otherwise this is a really great shot and a wonderful take on the challenge.', '2011-08-15 12:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
