(6505182, 967152, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good shot and a good representation for the challenge. I think the one thing that could be changed in this picture to help tell the story better would be to use greater depth of field to allow the background to be slightly more in focus to really portray the football reference and show the referee in his environment better.</td>', 'Good shot and a good representation for the challenge. I think the one thing that could be changed in this picture to help tell the story better would be to use greater depth of field to allow the background to be slightly more in focus to really portray the football reference and show the referee in his environment better.', '2011-08-15 14:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505184, 967266, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good representation of the challenge. The subject does include stripes but the photo is basically a representation of a "2 dimensional" object filling the frame. You did get light and shadow portrayed by draping the object over the edge of something however as a photo it is somewhat uninteresting due to it''s nature.</td>', 'Good representation of the challenge. The subject does include stripes but the photo is basically a representation of a "2 dimensional" object filling the frame. You did get light and shadow portrayed by draping the object over the edge of something however as a photo it is somewhat uninteresting due to it''s nature.', '2011-08-15 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
