(6505284, 967149, 61084, '<td valign="top">Karen? Not sure...but I had a feeling someone would do this. Great color and clarity. 8</td>', 'Karen? Not sure...but I had a feeling someone would do this. Great color and clarity. 8', '2011-08-15 16:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505291, 967383, 61084, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Steve shot. Great texture on the road, the tilted horizon line works well for a shot of this nature because it creates a sense of forward moment on the bikes as well as creating a dynamic leading line into the frame drawing your attention right up to the bikers.<br/> <br/>Nice overall clarity and tones. I like the tread marks and gravelly feel of the road/bike path, however if I was to find one nit pick I personally would have spot edited at least some of the larger black debris since it''s one of the first things that grabbed my attention.<br/> <br/>Great job. 8</td>', 'Looks like a Steve shot. Great texture on the road, the tilted horizon line works well for a shot of this nature because it creates a sense of forward moment on the bikes as well as creating a dynamic leading line into the frame drawing your attention right up to the bikers. Nice overall clarity and tones. I like the tread marks and gravelly feel of the road/bike path, however if I was to find one nit pick I personally would have spot edited at least some of the larger black debris since it''s one of the first things that grabbed my attention. Great job. 8', '2011-08-15 16:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505293, 967301, 61084, '<td valign="top">This is really great, and creative. Excellent clarity and I''m also a sucker for the Black and Gold color combo. Well done! 9</td>', 'This is really great, and creative. Excellent clarity and I''m also a sucker for the Black and Gold color combo. Well done! 9', '2011-08-15 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6505297, 967152, 61084, '<td valign="top">Nice color tones, great bokeh, and clarity. Love the DOF, but can''t help wanting to see this same composition stopped down one stop to see what a LITTLE more definition of the action in the background would look like. If it would be at the expense of the bokeh then I would say that you made the right call...no pun intended! 8</td>', 'Nice color tones, great bokeh, and clarity. Love the DOF, but can''t help wanting to see this same composition stopped down one stop to see what a LITTLE more definition of the action in the background would look like. If it would be at the expense of the bokeh then I would say that you made the right call...no pun intended! 8', '2011-08-15 16:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
