(6507912, 967229, 47470, '<td valign="top">The background, bench, and skirt work so well for this challenge, but the models pose (it looks awkward and uncomfortable) and the unnecessary image tilt hurt this, in my opinion.  I also would have preferred to see some kind of emotion on the model''s face.</td>', 'The background, bench, and skirt work so well for this challenge, but the models pose (it looks awkward and uncomfortable) and the unnecessary image tilt hurt this, in my opinion.  I also would have preferred to see some kind of emotion on the model''s face.', '2011-08-18 00:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507913, 966757, 49683, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few times if any I will comment on a 10 vote.  Awesome photography and edtting that brings this image into a realization of art.</td>', 'This is one of the few times if any I will comment on a 10 vote.  Awesome photography and edtting that brings this image into a realization of art.', '2011-08-18 00:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507926, 967369, 47470, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer to see the lighting a bit softer on his face and maybe a little more controlled so it doesn''t highlight his ear so much.  A different crop (more room above his head and more on the right to include the whole pitchfork) would have helped the composition.  Still, a great idea!</td>', 'I''d prefer to see the lighting a bit softer on his face and maybe a little more controlled so it doesn''t highlight his ear so much.  A different crop (more room above his head and more on the right to include the whole pitchfork) would have helped the composition.  Still, a great idea!', '2011-08-18 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507936, 967254, 47470, '<td valign="top">What an unfortunate placement of the pine needles behind his head.  That kind of hair on a bird is only for cartoons : )  Too bad this guy had his back to the sun, forcing you to blow out the background.</td>', 'What an unfortunate placement of the pine needles behind his head.  That kind of hair on a bird is only for cartoons : )  Too bad this guy had his back to the sun, forcing you to blow out the background.', '2011-08-18 00:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6507940, 966832, 47470, '<td valign="top">She needs to be in some extreme heels!  I also would have preferred a bit of context instead of a black background, though I understand that would have been much harder to hide the other half of the model that way.</td>', 'She needs to be in some extreme heels!  I also would have preferred a bit of context instead of a black background, though I understand that would have been much harder to hide the other half of the model that way.', '2011-08-18 00:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6508044, 966758, 86218, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to catch on to this..But love it. Not sure if maybe the shadow should have been a little stronger to get the message across but I also like the fact that it''s just a hint of shadow. A tad stronger would help. The title of course helped. Giving 8 but I have a feeling fast track voters are going to nail you. Pity</td>', 'Took me a while to catch on to this..But love it. Not sure if maybe the shadow should have been a little stronger to get the message across but I also like the fact that it''s just a hint of shadow. A tad stronger would help. The title of course helped. Giving 8 but I have a feeling fast track voters are going to nail you. Pity', '2011-08-18 04:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
