(6511455, 967338, 94815, '<td valign="top">But this is this summer and yet we contemplate last summer as we photograph a the new breeze as it reflects those of so many times before. Such a wonderfully contemplative, transcendental thought with (dare I say) metaphysical overtones. As some say, it''s the thought (e.g. title) that counts. Enought stripes to qualify and more artistry than expected.</td>', 'But this is this summer and yet we contemplate last summer as we photograph a the new breeze as it reflects those of so many times before. Such a wonderfully contemplative, transcendental thought with (dare I say) metaphysical overtones. As some say, it''s the thought (e.g. title) that counts. Enought stripes to qualify and more artistry than expected.', '2011-08-21 23:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
