(6511787, 967254, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great timing to get the beak open. Photographing birds is one of the most rewarding types of photography, and equally frustrating as you no doubt know. (I looked at your portfolio.) A few compositional errors and the bird''s face is too dark or overall U/E. You have a fabulous 500mm f/4 prime and I''m guessing you had very little time to shoot before it was gone?</td>', 'Great timing to get the beak open. Photographing birds is one of the most rewarding types of photography, and equally frustrating as you no doubt know. (I looked at your portfolio.) A few compositional errors and the bird''s face is too dark or overall U/E. You have a fabulous 500mm f/4 prime and I''m guessing you had very little time to shoot before it was gone?', '2011-08-22 04:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6511788, 967428, 108580, '<td valign="top">I didn''t comment but gave an 8. Like Steve (Yo_Spiff) says it made me pause and look. I loved the light play through the blinds and the odd composition with the 2 other frames in frame :) Nice work.</td>', 'I didn''t comment but gave an 8. Like Steve (Yo_Spiff) says it made me pause and look. I loved the light play through the blinds and the odd composition with the 2 other frames in frame :) Nice work.', '2011-08-22 04:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
