(6511930, 966891, 135744, '<td valign="top">@LoVi - hey thanks!! Yeah I had planned to inject him with some wire and glue a drum stick to his hand to get him grooving but didn''t want to damage my daughters duck. Guess I could still have made it look less static. Very pleased you loved the shot:)</td>', '@LoVi - hey thanks!! Yeah I had planned to inject him with some wire and glue a drum stick to his hand to get him grooving but didn''t want to damage my daughters duck. Guess I could still have made it look less static. Very pleased you loved the shot:)', '2011-08-22 10:10:59.000000', NULL, 0),
