(6511958, 967329, 106490, '<td valign="top">I want to thank everyone for the nice comments. This the first photo I have entered at DP Challenge and I knew that water and oil have been done a lot, so it did about as expected. I have done a lot of shots with water and the flag in the past and this challenge gave me an excuse to try it with oil and I was very pleased with the outcome. In fact, I will be experimenting with different types of oil in the future to see if it changes the properties of the circles. The choices of backgrounds and lighting are endless.<br/> <br/>Ed</td>', 'I want to thank everyone for the nice comments. This the first photo I have entered at DP Challenge and I knew that water and oil have been done a lot, so it did about as expected. I have done a lot of shots with water and the flag in the past and this challenge gave me an excuse to try it with oil and I was very pleased with the outcome. In fact, I will be experimenting with different types of oil in the future to see if it changes the properties of the circles. The choices of backgrounds and lighting are endless. Ed', '2011-08-22 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 0),
